{#
  One page of a post's replies — rendered both inline under a post in the
  feed and on its own for "Voir les commentaires précédents"
  (GET /groups/{id}/posts/{postId}/replies?before=…), which is why it
  extends nothing and carries the button with it: the JS replaces the
  button with whatever this returns.

  The button comes BEFORE the replies, and that is what makes the swap
  work without the JS having to reorder anything. Paging runs backwards
  here — older comments are fetched from the top — so the wrapper being
  replaced already sits above the thread, and replacing it with
  [older button][older replies] lands every card exactly where it belongs.
#}
{% if replies_prev_before_id %}
    <div class="groups-replies-more-wrapper mb-1">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-link px-0 groups-replies-more" style="min-height:44px;"
                data-url="/groups/{{ group.id }}/posts/{{ post.id }}/replies?before={{ replies_prev_before_id }}">
            Voir les commentaires précédents
        </button>
    </div>
{% endif %}

{% for row in replies %}
    {% include '@groups/partials/reply_card.html.twig' with { row: row, group: group, on_reports_page: on_reports_page|default(false) } only %}
{% endfor %}
